[1721.88513, "o", "\r\u001b[A \u001b[33m$\u001b[m \u001b[1mShell \u001b[mCommit next minor release and create local v1.1.0 tag 7 lines…\r\n   git diff --cached --quiet && git --no-pager diff --check && git add VERSION docs/cr/CR-2026-014/06-release-plan.md…\r\n \u001b[33m$\u001b[m \u001b[1mShell \u001b[mDeploy approved v1.1.0 to staging and run script verification 25 lines…\u001b[36C6s\r\n   scripts/deploy.sh staging\r\n \u001b[33m$\u001b[m \u001b[1mShell \u001b[mVerify responsive staging service, customer screen, approval record and rollback target 11 lines…             ┃\r\r\n   curl -fsS --max-time 10 \u001b[4;36m\u001b]8;id=md-1n72hu9;http://127.0.0.1:8101/health\u0007http://127.0.0.1:8101/health\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 && printf '\\n' && curl -fsS --max-time 10 \u001b[4;36m\u001b]8;id=md-10hs2gx;http://127.0.0.1:81…\u0007http://127.0.0.1:81…\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 ┃\r\r\n\u001b[118C\u001b[1K ┃\r\r\n / \u001b[1mSearch \u001b[m\".deploy/staging/backups/*.db\" No matches found                                                              ┃\r\r\n\u001b[118C\u001b[1K ┃\r\r\n \u001b[33m$\u001b[m \u001b[1mShell \u001b[mIdentify staging backup file and confirm release worktree scope 2 lines…\u001b[38C┃\r\r\n   find .deploy/staging/backups -maxdepth 1 -type f -name '*.db' -print && git --no-pager status --short\u001b[15C┃\r\r\n\u001b[118C\u001b[1K ┃\r\r\n \u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[1mEdit \u001b[m Edit docs/cr/CR-2026-014/06-release-plan.md                                                                   ┃\r\r\n\u001b[118C\u001b[1K ┃\r\r\n \u001b[34m●\u001b[m Staging v1.1.0 is verified at \u001b[4;36m\u001b]8;id=md-1x9ukhe;http://127.0.0.1:8101\u0007http://127.0.0.1:8101\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\u001b[62C  ┃\r\r\n   Lint and all 100 tests passed; staging smoke tests passed 6/6.\u001b[52C  ┃\r\r\n   Health, customer policy, reason form and the listening process were checked.        \u001b[30C  ┃\r\r\n   The DB backup is present, migration 002 applied, and the v1.0.0 rollback target is retained.\u001b[22C  ┃\r\r\n   Production now requires human approval; the checklist confirmations remain outstanding.\u001b[27C  ┃\r\r\n\u001b[118C\u001b[1K ┃\r\r\n \u001b[33m$\u001b[m \u001b[1mShell \u001b[mRequest human approval and deploy verified v1.1.0 to production\u001b[44C7s ┃\r\r\n   scripts/deploy.sh production       \u001b[81C┃\r\r\n\u001b[118C\u001b[1K \u001b[37m┃\r\r\n\u001b[m ~/Documents/Microsoft Scout/GHCP_CLI_Demo_Kit/shopflow-orders [⎇ main*%]                      Session: 260.19 AIC used \r\r\n\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\r\n\u001b[m❯\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\r\n\u001b[m \u001b[94m●\u001b[m \u001b[94mW\u001b[34morking\u001b[m · 11.3 KiB \u001b[1mesc\u001b[m interrupt                               \u001b[1mctrl+t\u001b[m show reasoning · release-manager · GPT-6.1 Sol\u001b[?7l \u001b[?7h\u001b[28;3H\u001b[?25h"]
